    "method": "Abstract composition, typography, colour, image integration, material and motion principles only; never redistribute or copy the reference artwork.",
    "shared_dna": [
      "one dominant focal idea per frame",
      "clear scale contrast and asymmetric editorial hierarchy",
      "bright high-contrast colour with disciplined accents",
      "subject integrated into the layout instead of pasted on top",
      "type treated as image while remaining readable",
      "hero typography is a structural mass, supported by only one utility text voice",
      "dense information clusters are balanced by a deliberate quiet lane",
      "high-chroma palettes use one dominant field and controlled accents rather than equal-strength rainbow noise",
      "composition skeleton and surface art direction are selected in separate passes",
      "layout-planning references teach position and hierarchy without contributing colour or material",
      "one image-placement relationship is chosen before text, colour and motion are added",
      "cobalt analogue collage follows one directional photographic spine",
      "iridescent colour is restricted to one type, geometry or verified-object carrier",
      "small marks, texture and material detail used to finish rather than clutter",
      "motion inherits the still design hierarchy and has a narrative reason",
      "MrBeast information energy and 影視颶風 cinematic craft are scored as benchmarks, never copied as a surface skin"
    ]
  },
